  "question": {
    "text": "The best method for the preparation of 2, 2-dimethylbutane is via the reaction of"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{Me}_{3} \\mathrm{CBr}$ and $\\mathrm{MeCH}_{2}$ Br in Na/ether",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\left(\\mathrm{Me}_{3} \\mathrm{C}\\right)_{2} \\mathrm{CuLi}$ and $\\mathrm{MeCH}_{2} \\mathrm{Br}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\left(\\mathrm{MeCH}_{2}\\right)_{2} \\mathrm{CuLi}$ and $\\mathrm{Me}_{3} \\mathrm{CBr}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{Me}_{3} \\mathrm{CMgl}$  and $\\mathrm{MeCH}_{2}l$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "2,2 - dimethyl butane is prepared from Corey House alkane synthesis. $\\left(\\mathrm{Me}_{3} \\mathrm{C}\\right)_{2} \\mathrm{Cul}_{2} \\mathrm{Li}+\\mathrm{MeCH}_{2} \\mathrm{Br} \\stackrel{\\mathrm{S}_{\\mathrm{N}}{2}}{\\longrightarrow}$\r\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{Me}_{3} \\mathrm{C}-\\mathrm{CH}_{2} \\mathrm{CH}_{3}+\\mathrm{Me}_{3} \\mathrm{C}CuLi\r\n$$"
